      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A community nurse went to an elderly man's home every day to give him insulin injections and to attend to dressings for his leg ulcer. She complained that he smoked incessantly, that the house was filled with smoke and that after her visit her chest tightened up and she frequently suffered from an asthma attack. She wondered if she could refuse to visit this particular patient."},
